From: Jakub Zelenka <bukka@php.net>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 21:46:18 +0100
Subject: Fix GHSA-f6gg-rchx-xw8j: mixed case HTTPS and FTPS

Determine TLS use from a case-insensitive comparison of the complete
URL scheme, preventing mixed-case HTTPS and FTPS URLs from downgrading
to plaintext. Add regression tests for both wrappers.

(cherry picked from commit cb68a63e8177f9dc25aba23c0d79c7da82ea69db)
(cherry picked from commit 061a2967440b9fab45946765f387546d3055b41f)
